WEBVTT

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

01:41.130 --> 01:43.340
Please escape, Your Highness.

01:44.770 --> 01:47.340
They will come here in droves soon.

01:47.340 --> 01:49.370
We will hold them off for you!

01:49.870 --> 01:52.540
Please, Your Highness, escape!

01:52.540 --> 01:57.540
Don't be stupid! You won't survive more
than a few days without me!

01:57.680 --> 02:01.520
Parting from me means...

02:01.520 --> 02:04.990
Our lives exist for your sake, Your Highness!

02:06.860 --> 02:09.420
It's our honor, as your soldiers,

02:09.420 --> 02:12.200
to have been granted the gift of life from you!

02:13.700 --> 02:15.260
You all...

02:15.260 --> 02:18.400
Your Highness, please stay safe!

02:21.840 --> 02:23.480
Huga.

02:24.140 --> 02:25.950
I know.

02:29.680 --> 02:31.490
It's over now.

02:47.100 --> 02:48.900
I was dreaming.

02:49.400 --> 02:51.040
Huga.

02:51.570 --> 02:53.550
It was a dream of the past.

03:00.680 --> 03:02.410
A dream?

03:02.410 --> 03:03.510
Huga.

03:03.510 --> 03:06.110
I often dream myself.

03:06.110 --> 03:10.090
Just yesterday, I dreamt I was swimming
in a sea made of strawberry parfait.

03:10.390 --> 03:14.160
Mistress, it's very difficult to swim
in a sea made of parfait.

03:14.160 --> 03:15.660
You don't say?

03:15.660 --> 03:16.890
Yes!

03:16.890 --> 03:17.890
Sawawa...

03:17.890 --> 03:19.130
Yes?

03:19.130 --> 03:21.100
Was there something you needed me for?

03:21.100 --> 03:23.860
Oh, I almost forgot!

03:23.870 --> 03:25.930
Sherwood is here to see you

03:25.930 --> 03:27.740
She is?

03:29.540 --> 03:30.670
Huga.

03:30.670 --> 03:34.520
What is it today, Sherwood?

03:36.110 --> 03:42.930
Which one of our brothers or sisters do you think
sent Duke Dracul out after you?

03:43.320 --> 03:44.590
How should I know?

03:44.590 --> 03:46.350
Sister!

03:46.350 --> 03:50.330
Since you entered into an alliance with me,
you mustn't keep secrets!

03:53.400 --> 03:56.930
Well, all of our siblings are our enemies.

03:56.930 --> 03:59.330
I won't be surprised, no matter which one it is.

03:59.330 --> 04:01.170
That's true, but...

04:01.170 --> 04:02.810
Sherwood...

04:03.210 --> 04:05.340
You need to be on guard too.

04:06.580 --> 04:09.740
Though it looks like I am the target for now,

04:09.750 --> 04:12.320
they may come after your head soon enough.

04:12.810 --> 04:14.820
I will remain on high alert

04:15.350 --> 04:17.120
What is it, little one?

04:17.120 --> 04:18.790
Huga.

04:18.790 --> 04:20.600
What's that?

04:21.260 --> 04:22.890
Huga.

04:23.960 --> 04:26.790
Don't mind it, it happens often.

04:26.800 --> 04:28.600
You're an eyesore!

04:28.860 --> 04:32.070
I told you not to pass by when I'm near!

04:32.070 --> 04:37.070
Be that as it may, if I don't pass through here,
I can't get to the dining room.

04:37.070 --> 04:38.880
Walk around the other way!

04:39.010 --> 04:41.210
Are you telling me to take the long way?

04:41.710 --> 04:43.280
I politely decline.

04:43.280 --> 04:47.550
Umm, since you two will be living together now,

04:47.550 --> 04:49.620
how about we stop the fights? Okay?

04:49.620 --> 04:53.320
Anyway! Don't pass in front of me!

04:53.320 --> 04:54.890
Liza...

04:54.890 --> 04:56.620
And if I say no?

04:56.630 --> 04:58.460
You too, Reiri...

04:58.460 --> 05:00.760
I dare you to try!

05:00.760 --> 05:03.940
Oh, are you looking to fight, dog?

05:04.670 --> 05:07.650
Umm, no fighting, please...

05:10.440 --> 05:14.310
Your mansion is always so lively, Sister.

05:14.310 --> 05:17.780
I'd prefer it quiet, though.

05:19.150 --> 05:22.420
Huh? Where's Princess Sherwood?

05:22.420 --> 05:23.550
She went home.

05:23.550 --> 05:25.250
Oh, I see.

05:25.250 --> 05:28.360
What's wrong, Hiro? You look disappointed.

05:28.360 --> 05:32.030
What?! Th..That's not it!

05:32.030 --> 05:34.760
Why would you say that? I'm...

05:34.760 --> 05:36.740
Hey, Hime, are you listening?

05:39.070 --> 05:42.050
Hey, where you going? Running away?

05:42.600 --> 05:44.470
I'm going for an evening stroll.

05:44.470 --> 05:46.940
Bah! Why don't you not come back from it?

05:46.940 --> 05:49.640
We don't need any vampires in this mansion!

05:49.640 --> 05:53.110
My, what a territorial dog.

05:53.580 --> 05:57.260
Have you marked your territory
around the mansion?

05:57.850 --> 06:00.920
You bitch! Keep an eye out in the dark!

06:00.920 --> 06:03.560
My, what a loud dog.

06:05.230 --> 06:07.040
Hiro, you here?

06:07.500 --> 06:09.660
Li..Liza, what's the matter?

06:09.660 --> 06:11.840
What's this?
Playing video games again?

06:12.430 --> 06:15.140
God, you're boring.

06:15.140 --> 06:16.950
You lose.

06:18.140 --> 06:20.340
Keep an eye out in the dark?

06:20.340 --> 06:24.350
How ridiculous.
We're the rulers of the night.

06:25.450 --> 06:31.360
I pity brainless dogs that know nothing
but how to crawl around on the ground.

06:43.730 --> 06:47.400
Hey, hey, I was wondering what that was,
and it's a vampire!

06:47.400 --> 06:51.370
Should I kill her? It'd be vengeance
for my fellow tribesmen.

06:51.870 --> 06:53.010
Werewolves...

06:53.010 --> 06:54.710
Knock it off, Alec.

06:54.710 --> 06:57.110
Karim, you scared?

06:57.110 --> 06:58.410
It's not that.

06:58.410 --> 07:00.680
Yes, it is, coward.

07:00.680 --> 07:01.850
Yo u-r e wrong'

07:01.850 --> 07:03.980
How am I wrong, coward?

07:03.990 --> 07:06.790
Say that again and I'll kill you!

07:06.790 --> 07:08.320
Oh, sounds like fun. Give it a shot!

07:08.320 --> 07:09.360
Excuse me, you two...

07:09.360 --> 07:11.190
Knock it off, you two!

07:11.190 --> 07:12.390
Shut up!

07:12.390 --> 07:13.930
Enough's enough!

07:13.930 --> 07:17.170
Have you forgotten our noble mission?

07:17.770 --> 07:21.240
We have a mission to carry out
our master's orders.

07:21.800 --> 07:24.170
Leave the vampire alone.

07:24.170 --> 07:25.980
Yeah, he's right.

07:26.440 --> 07:29.880
Hey! We really just gonna leave her?

07:29.880 --> 07:32.950
Hurry! We're running out of time.

07:33.480 --> 07:37.450
You know how close you were to dying?
Now scram!

07:38.450 --> 07:39.690
Master?

07:39.690 --> 07:41.330
Royalty?

07:46.290 --> 07:47.630
What?!

07:47.630 --> 07:49.500
Damn you, Hiro! That was dirty!

07:49.500 --> 07:50.800
What did you do just now?

07:50.800 --> 07:53.970
What? That was a perfectly acceptable combo.

07:54.170 --> 07:56.240
No one told me about this!

07:56.740 --> 07:59.540
Well, Liza, you didn't read the manual...

07:59.540 --> 08:03.890
You're completely useless in real battles,
but you're good at this?!

08:06.280 --> 08:07.920
What?

08:10.920 --> 08:14.060
Y..Your paw is so squishy.

08:15.320 --> 08:17.390
I'll kill you!

08:19.760 --> 08:21.400
Liza!

08:28.040 --> 08:29.850
That smell...

08:30.440 --> 08:35.820
Our beloved princess resides in this mansion.

08:36.410 --> 08:38.410
I thought I smelled my kind.

08:38.410 --> 08:41.180
Huh? Werewolves?

08:41.180 --> 08:43.660
What do you want this late at night?

08:44.850 --> 08:47.160
State your family name and village.

08:50.460 --> 08:52.100
Liza!

08:55.360 --> 08:57.170
Damn it...

08:58.470 --> 09:01.670
You're starting a fight without
even giving your name?

09:01.670 --> 09:03.310
SQ?

09:06.070 --> 09:08.880
My name is Liza Wildman.

09:08.880 --> 09:12.020
I'm the daughter of the almighty warrior,
Worg Wildman!

09:12.650 --> 09:14.920
Look at you! A half-breed!

09:15.680 --> 09:19.930
Come, you bastards who defile
the sanctity of the fight.

09:21.590 --> 09:26.440
What's a half-breed gonna do
against the three of us?

09:27.530 --> 09:31.200
I'll give you an honorable death. Be grateful!

09:32.170 --> 09:33.980
Well said!

09:40.540 --> 09:41.610
What?

09:41.610 --> 09:43.650
And then there were two.

09:47.380 --> 09:50.380
That's punishment for entering my mansion.

09:50.390 --> 09:51.790
Hime!

09:51.790 --> 09:53.620
Well, well...

09:53.620 --> 09:57.030
This is the first time we meet, Your Highness.

09:57.860 --> 10:01.100
Forgive me, but, how shall I put this...

10:01.100 --> 10:05.570
The three of us lack nothing
in our fighting abilities.

10:05.570 --> 10:06.930
Huga.

10:06.940 --> 10:08.570
Oh?

10:10.540 --> 10:14.140
Might you be soldiers in the Royal Guard?

10:14.140 --> 10:15.780
Immortals...

10:23.850 --> 10:25.490
Oh?

10:28.260 --> 10:32.030
Choosing how to die is very important
to a werewolf warrior.

10:32.630 --> 10:37.560
You've only got one life to live,
yet you became immortal soldiers?!

10:37.570 --> 10:39.370
Screw that!

10:42.100 --> 10:44.870
Hey, you said your name was Liza, right?

10:44.870 --> 10:47.810
I'll tell you this, Liza...

10:47.810 --> 10:50.880
This is how an immortal soldier fights!

10:53.680 --> 10:54.680
Liza!

10:54.680 --> 10:56.480
Hiro! Go protect Hime.

10:56.480 --> 10:58.120
O..Okay!

11:01.820 --> 11:04.590
You two get the princess.

11:04.590 --> 11:06.800
I'm gonna play with her.

11:16.340 --> 11:17.980
Huga.

11:43.630 --> 11:46.170
Prepare to die, Your Highness!

11:55.440 --> 11:57.280
Immortal soldiers...

11:57.280 --> 11:58.920
Huga.

11:59.650 --> 12:01.960
Flandre and I...

12:06.790 --> 12:09.860
Flandre's and my defenses are impenetrable.

12:09.860 --> 12:11.500
Huga.

12:20.900 --> 12:23.670
Hey, hey, Liza darling...

12:23.670 --> 12:26.050
Weren't you gonna kill me?

12:28.410 --> 12:33.550
Oh, yeah, there was something I always
wanted to ask a half-breed, if I met one.

12:34.480 --> 12:39.480
When your mother conceived you,
with that almighty warrior or whatever,

12:40.460 --> 12:42.440
which form was he in?

12:43.320 --> 12:46.890
Was he in his human form? Or...

12:46.890 --> 12:50.070
What do you think, half-breed?

12:53.000 --> 12:54.810
You bastard...

12:57.610 --> 13:00.540
For my father, and my brother...

13:00.540 --> 13:05.350
I promise I will kill you!

13:05.950 --> 13:09.420
A half-breed's gonna kill me, an immortal?

13:10.590 --> 13:13.450
Today's the day you die!

13:13.450 --> 13:15.760
I could say the same for you!

13:32.840 --> 13:34.480
Psyche!

13:39.250 --> 13:44.250
You can kill me a hundred times,
but I only need to kill you once.

13:45.420 --> 13:46.620
Then, I win.

13:46.620 --> 13:48.600
So what?!

13:52.060 --> 13:54.370
Okay, thank you.

13:56.730 --> 13:58.370
Interesting...

14:10.210 --> 14:13.350
Your Highness, aren't you starting to get tired?

14:13.350 --> 14:16.260
You needn't hold yourselves back. Come.

14:16.820 --> 14:19.350
We have the advantage in a war of attrition!

14:19.350 --> 14:21.160
Prepare to die!

14:32.630 --> 14:33.630
Karim!

14:33.630 --> 14:34.670
Flandre!

14:34.670 --> 14:36.310
Huga.

14:38.010 --> 14:39.640
Hime!

14:51.020 --> 14:52.390
Reiri!

14:52.390 --> 14:54.720
What's the meaning of this, Reiri?

14:54.720 --> 14:59.330
No reason, it's just that werewolves
are our sworn enemy.

15:00.090 --> 15:02.400
A vampire?

15:05.570 --> 15:07.900
It's just a single vampire.

15:07.900 --> 15:11.770
We're immortal soldiers!
She doesn't stand a chance!

15:11.770 --> 15:15.680
Answer truthfully:
How many of them can you take on?

15:15.680 --> 15:18.610
Conservatively speaking, one.

15:18.610 --> 15:20.590
All right, we've won.

15:21.380 --> 15:24.020
In your dreams!

15:25.150 --> 15:26.790
Karim!

15:27.560 --> 15:29.360
What's wrong, Sarome?!

15:30.490 --> 15:32.890
L..l can't move!

15:32.890 --> 15:33.930
Huga.

15:33.930 --> 15:36.060
She's so heavy!

15:36.060 --> 15:38.070
Damn it! Unhand me!

15:38.070 --> 15:39.700
Huga!

15:42.270 --> 15:45.180
Okay, let's take them both out.

15:50.710 --> 15:52.010
Huga.

15:55.520 --> 15:56.880
Liza...

15:56.880 --> 15:59.390
My, you look so worn out.

15:59.390 --> 16:01.190
You done, too?

16:01.190 --> 16:02.260
Yeah...

16:02.260 --> 16:04.420
But he'll revive shortly

16:04.430 --> 16:08.460
No matter. Flandre, throw him in the cellar.

16:08.460 --> 16:09.660
Huga.

16:09.660 --> 16:12.330
Hah! You had it coming.

16:12.330 --> 16:15.580
Don't underestimate the Wildman family...

16:17.310 --> 16:18.940
Liza!

16:27.650 --> 16:30.130
Well then, shall we go finish this?

16:43.100 --> 16:45.080
Where are we?

16:45.600 --> 16:49.610
I don't know, but it looks like we're
locked in from the outside.

16:50.610 --> 16:52.710
She is but a princess after all.

16:52.710 --> 16:57.010
If we combine our strength,
we can easily break down the door.

16:57.010 --> 16:59.290
When we fully recover, that is.

17:03.250 --> 17:04.890
Huga.

17:05.350 --> 17:06.850
Your Highness...

17:06.850 --> 17:08.860
I didn't expect you to come to us.

17:08.860 --> 17:11.930
You'll regret underestimating us.

17:15.560 --> 17:19.980
Wh..What?! Those couldn't be...

17:21.140 --> 17:23.120
Silver bullets?

17:26.640 --> 17:30.280
Yes, now you'll continue to die.

17:31.210 --> 17:33.520
Over and over...

17:42.390 --> 17:45.930
You are all werewolves,
proud of your monstrous strength.

17:45.930 --> 17:47.910
You won't die right away.

17:50.160 --> 17:52.070
D..Damn it...

17:52.070 --> 17:54.230
But no matter how many times you revive,

17:54.240 --> 17:56.300
no matter how many days it takes,

17:56.300 --> 17:59.410
I'll keep killing you,

17:59.410 --> 18:02.050
until the Flame of Life dies out within you.

18:08.820 --> 18:13.490
How did you get all these
cuts and bruises, Liza?

18:13.490 --> 18:17.270
Did you see me? Dad, Brother...

18:27.470 --> 18:30.340
No, that can't be...

18:30.340 --> 18:33.240
No, it's true, Hiro.

18:33.240 --> 18:35.710
There are no other members of
the Royal Family nearby.

18:35.710 --> 18:38.880
They are just disposable hired assassins.

18:38.880 --> 18:40.350
Disposable...

18:40.350 --> 18:45.050
They'll keep reviving as many times
as it takes to kill their target.

18:45.050 --> 18:48.620
The perfect assassins that only
Royalty can use...

18:48.620 --> 18:51.760
Th..That's just weird!

18:51.760 --> 18:54.300
Oh, but isn't it logical?

18:55.600 --> 19:00.140
You'll have to become useful to the
princess one of these days too.

19:00.670 --> 19:04.400
Hime... Hime would never do that!

19:04.410 --> 19:06.070
Are you sure?

19:06.070 --> 19:10.420
She may have a bad personality,
but she wouldn't...

19:10.950 --> 19:14.720
You're so cute, Hiro. I like that about you.

19:15.480 --> 19:17.480
But think about it.

19:17.490 --> 19:23.700
Hiro, why do you assume you're
her first immortal soldier?

19:25.030 --> 19:28.930
If she did have other immortal
soldiers in the past,

19:28.930 --> 19:32.210
then why aren't they here any more?

19:36.640 --> 19:41.810
Don't you think the fact that she can
be so ruthless is just wonderful?

19:46.280 --> 19:47.920
Hime!

19:57.430 --> 19:59.830
Hime! Open up, Hime!

19:59.830 --> 20:02.430
I have something I want to ask you!
Come on, Hime!

20:02.430 --> 20:04.070
Hime!

20:04.300 --> 20:07.700
Hime granted me the gift of life.

20:07.700 --> 20:11.580
I know that my life doesn't belong
to me alone any more.

20:31.830 --> 20:33.460
But...

20:34.130 --> 20:36.840
Don't make your master have to
take care of you so much.

20:38.030 --> 20:42.340
My life is in your hands until morning.

20:43.170 --> 20:47.340
I will not allow you to leave my side
from this moment on.

20:47.340 --> 20:48.980
Understood?

20:49.810 --> 20:52.680
But I...

20:52.680 --> 20:54.320
I...

21:23.640 --> 21:26.250
The gunshots stopped.

21:35.920 --> 21:37.560
Hime...

21:38.930 --> 21:41.240
Oh, Hiro, what are you doing here?

21:41.730 --> 21:46.730
I'll always obey Hime, no matter
what kind of person she is.

21:47.370 --> 21:49.670
So, Hime, I will...

21:49.670 --> 21:51.300
Hiro...

21:51.310 --> 21:55.620
Your Flame of Life is about to run out.

21:59.850 --> 22:01.660
Come, Hiro.

22:01.820 --> 22:04.520
I shall grant you the Flame of Life.

23:41.780 --> 23:44.520
Hime lives her life in the midst of a battle,

23:44.950 --> 23:49.950
a life-or-death battle with her siblings for
the throne of the King of Monsters.

23:49.960 --> 23:53.990
Will she live or die?
That's her inescapable fate,

23:53.990 --> 23:57.410
the destiny of those born of the king's loins.

23:57.800 --> 24:00.210
Look, I used a Western word!

24:00.830 --> 24:02.500
Next episode, "Princess Zombie"

24:02.500 --> 24:05.370
Zombies? He must be close by.

24:05.370 --> 24:06.370
He?

24:06.370 --> 24:06.870
One of my brothers.

24:07.810 --> 24:09.750
Huga, huga.
